{
  "_about": "Weapon platforms, gunsmith parts, paints and armor. Distances in metres, times in ms, spreads in radians. Part mods: fields ending in Mul multiply, true/false fields switch something on, others add. \"field\" = commendations needed (bought from Contacts). \"style\" says who the part is for. Every slot offers at least three real choices on every long gun, and none is simply better: each trades something away. Special mods: zoomAlt = a second magnification you flip to while aiming; thermal = living things glow and optical camo is seen through; autoTag = tags what you aim at for your crew; rangefinder = shows the range to what you aim at; glint = the lens flashes when you aim; armorMul / fleshMul = damage against armor / against health; subsonic = with a suppressor the shot gives nothing away.",
